WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.514 --> 00:00:14.260
"What's he doing here?"

2
00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:17.141
Perda whispered, peering into the throne room at Morb.

3
00:00:17.902 --> 00:00:19.443
Zann pressed a finger to his lips.

4
00:00:20.183 --> 00:00:22.425
He didn't know why Morb had returned to the palace.

5
00:00:22.745 --> 00:00:23.946
But he wanted to find out.

6
00:00:24.686 --> 00:00:27.528
All over the throne room, people were reacting to Morb's arrival.

7
00:00:27.548 --> 00:00:29.430
"Someone call the guards!"

8
00:00:29.850 --> 00:00:30.510
Rixa shouted.

9
00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:32.852
"What have you done with the king and queen?"

10
00:00:33.236 --> 00:00:34.117
someone else demanded.

11
00:00:34.837 --> 00:00:36.338
Another man marched over to Morb.

12
00:00:36.358 --> 00:00:39.881
"Your presence here is highly unacceptable!"

13
00:00:40.261 --> 00:00:40.781
he declared.

14
00:00:41.522 --> 00:00:44.044
Morb just sat there, smiling calmly.

15
00:00:44.064 --> 00:00:47.766
"Is that any way to speak to the new king of Magica?"

16
00:00:47.786 --> 00:00:51.429
"This has gone on long enough!"

17
00:00:51.849 --> 00:00:52.510
Rixa shouted.

18
00:00:52.530 --> 00:00:55.932
"It was a mistake for you to show your face here again.

19
00:00:56.673 --> 00:01:01.096
By the power of the government of Magica, I hereby pronounce you under arrest."

20
00:01:01.844 --> 00:01:04.366
Rubbing her hands together, Rixa pointed at Morb.

21
00:01:04.386 --> 00:01:06.647
"Immobilize!" she intoned.

22
00:01:07.427 --> 00:01:08.928
Energy shot from her fingertips.

23
00:01:09.668 --> 00:01:13.170
Chuckling, Morb casually held up his hand to block the spell.

24
00:01:13.831 --> 00:01:16.972
The spell bounced off Morb's hand and struck Rixa instead.

25
00:01:16.992 --> 00:01:21.295
"No!" she cried as her entire body went stiff.

26
00:01:21.315 --> 00:01:23.636
"You can't do this!"

27
00:01:24.517 --> 00:01:25.957
"Ah, but I can."

28
00:01:26.798 --> 00:01:28.199
Morb leaned back on the throne.

29
00:01:28.839 --> 00:01:33.265
Glancing around the room, he added, "Would anyone else like to try to arrest me?"

30
00:01:34.165 --> 00:01:35.125
Nobody said a word.

31
00:01:35.946 --> 00:01:41.247
Zann spotted a few people exchanging nervous glances, while others stared fearfully at the hulking trolls.

32
00:01:41.267 --> 00:01:44.708
"Nobody? Are you sure?"

33
00:01:45.468 --> 00:01:47.349
Morb stared at a white-haired old man.

34
00:01:47.369 --> 00:01:49.129
"How about you?

35
00:01:49.669 --> 00:01:50.650
Speak up, man!"

36
00:01:51.470 --> 00:01:53.351
Morb pointed his finger at the old man.

37
00:01:54.051 --> 00:01:59.028
Energy sizzled outward, dragging the man forward as if he'd been caught by a fishhook.

38
00:01:59.048 --> 00:02:00.570
"We have to do something!"

39
00:02:00.930 --> 00:02:05.314
Perda whispered as Morb pinned the white-haired man against the ceiling with a Levitation spell.

40
00:02:05.334 --> 00:02:07.075
"Like what?"

41
00:02:07.556 --> 00:02:08.016
Zann said.

42
00:02:08.036 --> 00:02:10.358
"If Morb sees us, we're doomed!"

43
00:02:11.419 --> 00:02:14.261
Tired of toying with the old man, Morb let him fall.

44
00:02:15.002 --> 00:02:20.206
Fortunately the man quickly rubbed his hands together and slowed down just in time to land safely on

45
00:02:20.246 --> 00:02:20.667
the floor.

46
00:02:20.687 --> 00:02:22.468
"Anyone else?"

47
00:02:23.109 --> 00:02:23.689
Morb asked.

48
00:02:24.490 --> 00:02:26.652
Slib cleared his throat and stepped forward.

49
00:02:27.528 --> 00:02:30.469
"I have something to say," he announced loudly.

50
00:02:31.390 --> 00:02:32.850
He bowed toward Morb.

51
00:02:32.870 --> 00:02:37.452
"I will be honored to serve the new King of Magica."

52
00:02:38.613 --> 00:02:41.534
There were murmurs of dismay from all over the room.

53
00:02:42.334 --> 00:02:43.715
Morb raised one eyebrow.

54
00:02:43.735 --> 00:02:47.136
"I see," he said, sounding amused.

55
00:02:47.837 --> 00:02:48.777
"What's your name?"

56
00:02:48.797 --> 00:02:51.638
"I am Slib, Your Majesty.

57
00:02:52.078 --> 00:02:53.219
At your service."

58
00:02:54.199 --> 00:02:56.020
Zann didn't hear what Morb said next.

59
00:02:56.840 --> 00:03:00.401
Zann had just noticed Zing pawing at a beetle on the floor nearby.

60
00:03:00.421 --> 00:03:03.882
"Zing!" Zann whispered as loudly as he dared.

61
00:03:03.902 --> 00:03:06.743
"Quiet!" Zing glanced at him.

62
00:03:07.343 --> 00:03:10.324
The beetle took the opportunity to dart into a crack in the floor.

63
00:03:11.024 --> 00:03:14.745
When Zing realized the beetle had escaped, he let out a whistle of annoyance.

64
00:03:14.765 --> 00:03:17.006
"Zing, hush!"

65
00:03:17.446 --> 00:03:18.626
Gliss whispered anxiously.

66
00:03:19.346 --> 00:03:20.787
Zann peeked into the throne room.

67
00:03:21.567 --> 00:03:24.167
Morb and the others were too far away to hear Zing's whistle.

68
00:03:24.428 --> 00:03:25.928
But something else had heard it.

69
00:03:26.776 --> 00:03:31.138
Zann gasped as he saw a bunch of the tiny, stinging dragons swarming toward them.

70
00:03:32.459 --> 00:03:34.639
"Run!" Zann whispered frantically.

71
00:03:37.361 --> 00:03:38.721
The tiny dragons were fast.

72
00:03:39.021 --> 00:03:40.942
They caught up with the kids halfway down the hall.

73
00:03:40.962 --> 00:03:42.623
"Get away!"

74
00:03:43.043 --> 00:03:45.804
Gliss cried, batting at the creatures buzzing around her hair.

75
00:03:46.645 --> 00:03:49.826
Zing let out a whistle as another tiny dragon darted in and stung him.

76
00:03:50.706 --> 00:03:54.188
He blasted it with flames, but three more flew over and took its place.

77
00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:56.201
"Should we zap away?"

78
00:03:56.521 --> 00:03:57.261
Perda exclaimed.

79
00:03:58.382 --> 00:04:00.383
Zann grimaced as one of the dragons stung him.

80
00:04:01.103 --> 00:04:04.205
"We can't," he said, gritting his teeth against the pain.

81
00:04:04.986 --> 00:04:06.446
"Not with Morb so close.

82
00:04:06.807 --> 00:04:08.167
He might still be tracking us."

83
00:04:08.187 --> 00:04:09.788
"Zann's right."

84
00:04:10.169 --> 00:04:12.150
Darb ducked as a dragon tried to strike him.

85
00:04:12.170 --> 00:04:14.751
"We've got to lose them some other way."

86
00:04:14.771 --> 00:04:16.452
"But how?"

87
00:04:16.852 --> 00:04:19.534
Gliss was trying to shield her head with her arms as she ran.

88
00:04:20.674 --> 00:04:22.175
The kids rounded another corner.

89
00:04:22.836 --> 00:04:26.089
Just ahead was a small courtyard with a large fountain in the middle.

90
00:04:26.109 --> 00:04:28.810
"There!" Zann cried, pointing.

91
00:04:28.830 --> 00:04:30.271
"Run under the fountain.

92
00:04:31.111 --> 00:04:32.592
Maybe that'll slow them down."

93
00:04:33.332 --> 00:04:37.514
He led the way out to the courtyard, leaping into the water and racing through the spray.

94
00:04:38.294 --> 00:04:41.975
As soon as the stinging dragons flew under the water, they were knocked into the pool.

95
00:04:42.816 --> 00:04:44.696
They popped up, sputtering and drenched.

96
00:04:45.857 --> 00:04:49.098
Zann and the others raced into another room on the other side of the courtyard.

97
00:04:49.739 --> 00:04:50.599
Darb glanced back.

98
00:04:50.619 --> 00:04:52.360
"The dragons are still coming!"

99
00:04:52.740 --> 00:04:53.140
he cried.

100
00:04:53.888 --> 00:04:54.508
"What dragons?"

101
00:04:54.948 --> 00:04:55.769
a new voice asked.

102
00:04:56.529 --> 00:04:58.189
Zann saw someone step into the room.

103
00:04:58.549 --> 00:04:59.230
It was Yog!

104
00:04:59.250 --> 00:05:00.670
"What's going on?"

105
00:05:01.050 --> 00:05:05.071
Yog looked confused as a few tiny, wet dragons buzzed into the room.

106
00:05:05.832 --> 00:05:06.752
"Where did those come from?"

107
00:05:06.772 --> 00:05:08.972
"Morb brought them!"

108
00:05:09.373 --> 00:05:10.453
Perda said breathlessly.

109
00:05:11.193 --> 00:05:12.433
Yog rubbed his hands together.

110
00:05:12.453 --> 00:05:16.194
A glowing purple wall sprang up, blocking the stinging dragons.

111
00:05:17.075 --> 00:05:18.195
"There," Yog said.

112
00:05:18.215 --> 00:05:19.696
"Now, what's this about Morb?

113
00:05:20.076 --> 00:05:21.056
He's here in the palace?"

114
00:05:21.988 --> 00:05:24.249
Zann and his friends told Yog the whole story.

115
00:05:25.029 --> 00:05:26.930
Yog healed their stings while he listened.

116
00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:29.151
By the end he looked grim.

117
00:05:29.171 --> 00:05:31.812
"A magic-sucking machine, huh?"

118
00:05:32.192 --> 00:05:32.612
he said.

119
00:05:32.632 --> 00:05:34.933
"I've heard stories about that machine.

120
00:05:35.233 --> 00:05:37.794
I always thought they were just tall tales from the Old Times."

121
00:05:37.814 --> 00:05:40.075
"They're not," Gliss said.

122
00:05:40.095 --> 00:05:42.696
"At least Morb's trolls don't think so."

123
00:05:42.716 --> 00:05:46.058
"I'd better go see what's happening in the throne room," Yog said.

124
00:05:46.078 --> 00:05:49.639
"You kids should get out of the palace before Morb realizes you're here."

125
00:05:49.659 --> 00:05:51.520
"But we want to help!"

126
00:05:51.884 --> 00:05:52.404
Perda said.

127
00:05:52.424 --> 00:05:58.046
"You can help by finding Fala and telling her what happened," replied Yog, already heading for the door.

128
00:05:58.066 --> 00:06:00.707
"She'll know how to contact Venna and the others.

129
00:06:01.427 --> 00:06:02.387
There's no time to lose!"

130
00:06:03.148 --> 00:06:04.488
"He's right," Darb said.

131
00:06:05.208 --> 00:06:05.868
Zann nodded.

132
00:06:05.888 --> 00:06:07.209
"Let's get out of here.

133
00:06:07.989 --> 00:06:09.469
I think the exit is this way."

134
00:06:10.530 --> 00:06:12.650
He raced down the hallway and around the corner.

135
00:06:12.670 --> 00:06:17.252
"Oof!" he grunted as he smacked headlong into a running troll.
